{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233210","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1423321001:1":{"text":"まず、釣り針に釣り餌をひっかけて、竿を投げて、ウキを観察する……なるほど。私もやってみる！","source_cn":"先往鱼钩上挂上饵料，再甩钩，观察浮漂……我大概了解了。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E571589E480BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1423321002:0":{"text":"何度も練習を繰り返し、オーロナはついにやや小ぶりなニジソメマスを釣り上げた。","source_cn":"练习多次后，欧罗娜终于钓上了一条体型较小的染虹鳟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32BE14F71E76FE57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423321003:1":{"text":"釣れたわ！","source_cn":"上钩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD97174CAF641FF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"matched_item_resource","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423321004:0":{"text":"カラフルな鱗、規則的な丸い斑点……本に書いてあったニジソメマスで間違いないわね！本物を見たのは初めて……","source_cn":"鳞片的颜色五彩斑斓，上面有规律的圆形斑点……这是书上提...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B51204936E2159B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title